osts O(","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" log ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":") space in all.","type":"text"}]},{"code":["import PersistentTrees","","let empty = PersistentTreeSet<Int>()","let one = empty.inserting(5)","let two = one.inserting(3)","let three = two.removing(5)","Array(one)                         \/\/ [5]","Array(two)                         \/\/ [3, 5]","Array(three)                       \/\/ [3]"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The trees are weight-balanced: neither subtree of a vertex holds more than three times the keys"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the other. Union, intersection, difference and symmetric difference split one tree by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"other’s root and join the halves, in O("},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"m","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" log("},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"m"}]},{"type":"text","text":" + 1)) for sets of "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"m"}]},{"type":"text","text":" ≤ "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" elements,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and a subtree both operands share is kept whole without being visited. Two versions a few edits"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"apart therefore merge in time proportional to those edits."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A version converts to Grafluent’s "},{"code":"BinaryTree","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with "},{"code":"BinaryTree(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", its elements or keys as"},{"type"